                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Product Readiness:</b> Ensure that the product delivers the expected functionality and customer value.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Technical Readiness:</b> Validate infrastructure, integrations, security, performance, and deployment requirements.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Customer Readiness:</b> Provide customers with clear information, onboarding resources, and support.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Team Alignment:</b> Ensure product, development, marketing, sales, operations, and support teams understand the launch plan.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Launch Strategy:</b> Establish clear positioning, communication, distribution, and customer acquisition activities.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i> <b>Measurement:</b> Define key performance indicators to evaluate launch performance and customer response.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

